Manage assignees

Usage:
  assignee [command]

Available Commands:
  completion  Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  create      Create a new assignee
  delete      Delete an assignee
  help        Help about any command
  list        List all assignees
  set         Set the active assignee
  whoami      Show the active assignee

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for assignee

Use "assignee [command] --help" for more information about a command.
